# based on https://github.com/libbpf/libbpf-bootstrap #

need to place files inside the examples/c directory and run make i

will scan for a given user (uid), all new process spawn for this user

and for each new process it will dump all opened files, and UDP network flows (send and received)

finish with CTRL+C will dump the remaining open process

use C++ 17 features on user side

